# The round is hashed byte for byte. Line-ending normalisation would change the
# digest and turn a valid round into an apparent forgery, so git must leave
# these files exactly as written. The current round happens to contain no
# newlines at all, but that is the encoder's choice, not a guarantee.
web/src/data/round.json   -text
agent/data/round.json     -text

* text=auto
